<ul id="A1.I19" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I19.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I19.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I19.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I19.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Calendar interpretation:</span> Accurately reads and interprets complex sports scheduling calendars with multiple teams and dates</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I19.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I19.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I19.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I19.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Selective information extraction:</span> Identifies specific matches based on league criteria (German teams in this case)</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I19.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I19.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I19.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I19.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Date and opponent recognition:</span> Precisely extracts match dates and opponent team names from visual calendar data</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I19.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I19.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I19.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I19.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Context-aware filtering:</span> Understands the relationship between team leagues and provides relevant match information</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
</section>
</article>
